  <jpcrp_cor:NumberOfUnconsolidatedSubsidiariesAndAssociatesAccountedForUsingEquityMethodAndNamesOfMajorEntitiesAccountedForUsingEquityMethodTextBlock contextRef="CurrentYearDuration">&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;line-height:13pt;"&gt;２  持分法の適用に関する事項&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:11pt;"&gt;　　　持分法を適用した関連会社数　6社&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:11pt;"&gt;　　　会社名&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="tbld" style="text-align:center;margin-left:40pt;margin-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"&gt;
&lt;table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" class="align_center" style="border-collapse:collapse;border:solid 0pt #000000;width:400pt;table-layout:fixed;"&gt;
&lt;colgroup&gt;
